Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get comment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{

  "product_id": "{{productId}}",
  "comment": "This is a sencond comment"

}

